sentences.l:
And whomever I shall perceive, apart from the gods, willing
having gone to help either the Trojans or the Danaans,
struck, not in due order, shall he come to Olympus;

And when indeed to one place coming together they came,
they dashed together hides, and spears, and the might of men
in bronze breastplates;

meanwhile Hector’s swift horses
came through the press of the fight, bearing a bold charioteer,
Hector;
